B.Ii=new A.bc(B.bX,["RT-TEC: Real-Time Trade Eligibility Classifier","Sub-10ms ML system for real-time trade decisions","assets/images/RT_TEC.png","Developed a production-grade, real-time trading decision system using FastAPI and NVIDIA Triton for GPU-accelerated ML inference. The system determines trade eligibility in milliseconds, ensuring compliance and safety in high-frequency trading environments.","Key features include sub-10ms latency, fail-safe design, multi-layer validation, and comprehensive audit trails using PostgreSQL. The architecture incorporates Feast and Redis for real-time feature serving, RedPanda for market data ingestion, and Prometheus with Grafana for monitoring. The system supports hot-swappable models, A/B testing, and version management, making it ideal for high-frequency trading firms and algorithmic trading platforms.",B.Gx,"https://github.com/Aashay7/RT-TEC","Personal Project / Lead Developer","Jun 2023 - Dec 2023","In Progress"],t.yf)
B.Gq=A.b(s(["NeRF","3D Reconstruction","TensorFlow","PyTorch","Slurm","NumPy"]),t.s)
B.Ig=new A.bc(B.bX,["3D View Synthesis using NeRF","Neural Radiance Fields for novel view generation","assets/images/NeRFCVPoster.jpeg","Implemented 3D scene reconstruction using volumetric rendering and ray sampling techniques, based on the NeRF paper (https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.08934). Final training on IU\u2019s Carbonate GPU cluster using TensorFlow. Used both PyTorch and TF for experimentation.","This project involved creating a neural network that can generate novel views of a scene from a sparse set of input images. The model learns to represent the scene as a continuous volumetric field, allowing it to synthesize new perspectives by sampling rays through the volume. The implementation was optimized for performance and accuracy, leveraging advanced techniques like positional encoding and hierarchical sampling.",B.Gq,"https://example.com/3d-view-synthesis","Lead Developer","Jan 2022 - May 2022","Completed"],t.yf)
B.GC=A.b(s(["IoT","Wearables","Time Series","Anomaly Detection","Arduino","Sensors","Python"]),t.s)
B.Ih=new A.bc(B.bX,["IoT Health Monitor for Rescue Teams","Health tracking system with ML insights",u.D,"Monitored vitals like heartbeat, humidity, and temperature using wearable IoT. ML models used for real-time health predictions of rescue teams. Project focused on deployment stability and sensor accuracy.","Designed a low-power wearable stack (microcontroller + sensors) streaming via BLE/Wi-Fi to a gateway. Implemented feature engineering on time-series vitals, anomaly detection for fatigue/heat stress, and alert thresholds. Emphasis on robustness, calibration, and false-positive control in field conditions.",B.GC,u.D,"Student / Researcher","Jan 2018 - Apr 2018","Completed"],t.yf)
B.Gn=A.b(s(["NLP","BRNN","Seq2Seq","Attention","TensorFlow","Chatbot"]),t.s)
B.If=new A.bc(B.bX,["Chatbot with BRNN","Bi-directional RNN for sequence dialogue","https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?chatbot,ai","Created a chatbot using Bidirectional RNNs to process contextual replies. Based on the end-to-end memory network concept. Trained using cleaned text corpora in a TensorFlow-based architecture.","Built data pipeline for tokenization, vocab pruning, and OOV handling. Implemented BRNN encoder\u2013decoder with attention; tuned teacher forcing and beam search decoding. Evaluated with BLEU/perplexity and human judgments for response coherence.",B.Gn,"https://example.com/brnn-chatbot","NLP Engineer","Jul 2017 - Dec 2017","Completed"],t.yf)
