B.Ij=new A.bc(B.bX,["Distributed Farmers Market (Blockchain)","Ethereum dApp using Truffle framework","https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?blockchain,crypto","Built a decentralized transparent marketplace for farmers using Ethereum and the Truffle framework. Included buyer/seller contract logic, wallet auth, and item listing on the blockchain.","Wrote Solidity smart contracts for listing, escrow, and fulfillment; integrated Web3 wallet auth (MetaMask) and event-driven UI. Implemented Truffle migrations, Ganache local testing, and basic gas optimizations. Frontend stack used modular JS with a clean, minimal UI.",B.FY,"https://example.com/farmers-market-dapp","Full-stack Developer","Jul 2017 - Dec 2017","Completed"],t.yf)
