B.Ic=new A.bc(B.bX,["Earthquake Detection with Twitter Alerts","IoT sensors + automated earthquake reporting","https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?earthquake,alert","Arduino-based motion sensors used to detect seismic activity. Triggered automated Twitter alerts using Ethernet modules. Calibrated accelerometer for noise filtering and false positive reduction.","Calibrated accelerometer bias/drift; implemented band-pass filtering and dynamic thresholds to detect seismic-like patterns. On trigger, posted alerts via API with rate-limit safeguards. Focused on latency, reliability, and low-power behavior.",B.G0,"https://example.com/earthquake-iot-alerts","Embedded Engineer","Jul 2017 - Dec 2017","Completed"],t.yf)
