B.Ie=new A.bc(B.bX,["OCR Book Recommender","Goodreads + OCR + KMeans clustering","https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?books,ml","Built an OCR-based book scanner that fetches metadata from Goodreads and recommends similar books using KMeans. Integrated a Scrapy-based web crawler and a fuzzy-matching title resolver.","Used OCR preprocessing (binarization, deskew, denoise) and text cleanup; crawled metadata and reviews, engineered TF-IDF/embeddings, and clustered with KMeans to suggest similar titles. Added rule-based tie-breakers on ratings/genres for better UX.",B.Gm,"https://example.com/ocr-recommender","Data Scientist","Jul 2017 - Dec 2017","Completed"],t.yf)
